---
import ExampleSection from "../../ExampleSection.astro";
import ExampleCodeBlock from "../../ExampleCodeBlock.astro";
import CodeSnippet from "../../CodeSnippet.astro";
---

<ExampleSection
    id="budget-segment"
    eyebrow="Three-plus thumb patterns"
    title="Budget allocator (segment drag)"
    status="gap"
>
    <Fragment slot="description">
        The same three-thumb split with <code>interaction="range"</code>. Dragging one of the two interior bars shifts
        its share left or right without resizing it: the two thumbs bounding that bar move together, the categories on
        either side absorb the change, and the outer thumbs stay where they are. The first and last bars have only one
        thumb, so pressing there still moves that nearest thumb.
    </Fragment>
    <Fragment slot="disclosure">
        Moving one category necessarily reallocates the shares on either side. A public design still needs an explicit
        way to choose movable segments and equivalent keyboard and accessibility operations.
    </Fragment>
    <div slot="demo" style="position: relative">
        <style is:global>
            #budget-segment-range {
                --track-height: 50px;
                --thumb-size: 36px;
            }
            #budget-segment-range::slider-track {
                border-radius: 25px;
            }
            #budget-segment-range::slider-segment {
                border-radius: 0;
            }
            #budget-segment-range::slider-thumb(*) {
                border: 4px solid #ffffff;
                background-color: white;
                background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg width='24' height='24' viewBox='0 0 24 24' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cpath fill='none' stroke='%230b1220' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='bevel' stroke-width='1.5' d='M15.3 16.78l4.11-4.11a1 1 0 000-1.41l-4-4M8.7 7.22L4.59 11.33a1 1 0 000 1.41l4 4'/%3E%3C/svg%3E");
                background-position: center;
                background-repeat: no-repeat;
                background-size: 60%;
                box-shadow:
                    0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3),
                    0 2px 4px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            }

            #budget-segment-range::slider-segment(1) {
                border-radius: 25px 0 0 25px;
                background-color: #e53935;
            }
            #budget-segment-range::slider-segment(2) {
                background-color: #8e24aa;
                cursor: grab;
            }
            #budget-segment-range::slider-segment(3) {
                background-color: #f57c00;
                cursor: grab;
            }
            #budget-segment-range::slider-segment(4) {
                border-radius: 0 25px 25px 0;
                background-color: #3949ab;
            }

            .budget-segment-labels {
                position: absolute;
                inset: 0;
                pointer-events: none;
            }
            .budget-segment-label {
                position: absolute;
                top: 0;
                left: var(--budget-segment-label-center);
                translate: -50% 25%;
                color: white;
                text-align: center;
                font-size: 0.875rem;
                text-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
                line-height: 1.2;
                pointer-events: none;
                z-index: 1;
            }
            #budget-segment-label-0 {
                --budget-segment-label-center: 12.5%;
            }
            #budget-segment-label-1 {
                --budget-segment-label-center: 37.5%;
            }
            #budget-segment-label-2 {
                --budget-segment-label-center: 62.5%;
            }
            #budget-segment-label-3 {
                --budget-segment-label-center: 87.5%;
            }

            .budget-segment-label strong {
                font-size: 1rem;
                font-weight: 700;
            }

            @media (max-width: 700px) {
                #budget-segment-range {
                    --track-height: 44px;
                    --thumb-size: 32px;
                }
                #budget-segment-range::slider-track {
                    border-radius: 22px;
                }
                #budget-segment-range::slider-segment(1) {
                    border-radius: 22px 0 0 22px;
                }
                #budget-segment-range::slider-segment(4) {
                    border-radius: 0 22px 22px 0;
                }
                .budget-segment-label {
                    font-size: 0.76rem;
                    line-height: 1.1;
                    translate: -50% 30%;
                }
                .budget-segment-label strong {
                    font-size: 0.86rem;
                }
            }

            @media (max-width: 420px) {
                .budget-segment-label {
                    font-size: 0.66rem;
                    line-height: 1;
                    translate: -50% 36%;
                }
                .budget-segment-label strong {
                    display: none;
                }
            }
        </style>
        <div class="budget-range-wrapper">
            <rangegroup id="budget-segment-range" min="0" max="100">
                <legend class="visually-hidden">Budget allocator endpoints</legend>
                <label class="visually-hidden">
                    Groceries/Rent separator
                    <input type="range" value="25" />
                </label>
                <label class="visually-hidden">
                    Rent/Transport separator
                    <input type="range" value="50" />
                </label>
                <label class="visually-hidden">
                    Transport/Internet separator
                    <input type="range" value="75" />
                </label>
            </rangegroup>
            <div id="budget-segment-labels" class="budget-segment-labels">
                <div id="budget-segment-label-0" class="budget-segment-label"></div>
                <div id="budget-segment-label-1" class="budget-segment-label"></div>
                <div id="budget-segment-label-2" class="budget-segment-label"></div>
                <div id="budget-segment-label-3" class="budget-segment-label"></div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div id="budget-segment-announcer" aria-live="polite" role="status" class="visually-hidden"></div>
    </div>
    <ExampleCodeBlock slot="code">
        <CodeSnippet
            lang="html"
            code={`
<rangegroup id="budget-segment-range" min="0" max="100">
  <legend>Budget allocator endpoints</legend>
  <label>Groceries / Rent     <input type="range" value="25"></label>
  <label>Rent / Transport     <input type="range" value="50"></label>
  <label>Transport / Internet <input type="range" value="75"></label>
</rangegroup>

<div class="budget-segment-labels">
  <div class="budget-segment-label" id="budget-segment-label-0"></div>
  <div class="budget-segment-label" id="budget-segment-label-1"></div>
  <div class="budget-segment-label" id="budget-segment-label-2"></div>
  <div class="budget-segment-label" id="budget-segment-label-3"></div>
</div>
`}
        />
        <CodeSnippet
            lang="css"
            code={`
rangegroup {
  --track-height: 50px;
  --thumb-size: 36px;
}
rangegroup::slider-track {
  block-size: 50px;
  border-radius: 25px;
}
rangegroup::slider-segment { border-radius: 0; }
rangegroup::slider-segment(1) {
  border-radius: 25px 0 0 25px;
  background-color: #e53935;
}
rangegroup::slider-segment(2) {
  background-color: #8e24aa;
  cursor: grab;
}
rangegroup::slider-segment(3) {
  background-color: #f57c00;
  cursor: grab;
}
rangegroup::slider-segment(4) {
  border-radius: 0 25px 25px 0;
  background-color: #3949ab;
}
rangegroup::slider-thumb(*) {
  inline-size: 36px;
  block-size: 36px;
  border: 4px solid white;
  background-color: white;
  background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg width='24' height='24' viewBox='0 0 24 24' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cpath fill='none' stroke='%230b1220' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='bevel' stroke-width='1.5' d='M15.3 16.78l4.11-4.11a1 1 0 000-1.41l-4-4M8.7 7.22L4.59 11.33a1 1 0 000 1.41l4 4'/%3E%3C/svg%3E");
  background-position: center;
  background-repeat: no-repeat;
  background-size: 60%;
  box-shadow:
    0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, .3),
    0 2px 4px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, .1);
}
.budget-segment-labels {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  pointer-events: none;
}
.budget-segment-label {
  position: absolute;
  top: 0;
  left: var(--budget-segment-label-center);
  translate: -50% 25%;
  color: white;
  text-align: center;
  text-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0, 0, 0, .5);
  pointer-events: none;
}
#budget-segment-label-0 { --budget-segment-label-center: 12.5%; }
#budget-segment-label-1 { --budget-segment-label-center: 37.5%; }
#budget-segment-label-2 { --budget-segment-label-center: 62.5%; }
#budget-segment-label-3 { --budget-segment-label-center: 87.5%; }

@media (max-width: 700px) {
  rangegroup {
    --track-height: 44px;
    --thumb-size: 32px;
  }
  rangegroup::slider-track {
    block-size: 44px;
    border-radius: 22px;
  }
  rangegroup::slider-thumb(*) {
    inline-size: 32px;
    block-size: 32px;
  }
}
`}
        />
        <CodeSnippet
            lang="javascript"
            code={`
const rg = document.querySelector("#budget-segment-range");
const announcer = document.querySelector("#budget-segment-announcer");
const labels = document.querySelectorAll(".budget-segment-label");
const categories = ["Groceries", "Rent", "Transport", "Internet"];

const update = () => {
  const stops = [0, ...rg.values, 100];
  let announcement = "Budget updated. ";
  labels.forEach((label, i) => {
    const pct = Math.round(stops[i + 1] - stops[i]);
    label.style.setProperty(
      "--budget-segment-label-center",
      (stops[i] + stops[i + 1]) / 2 + "%"
    );
    label.replaceChildren();
    const categoryName = document.createElement("strong");
    categoryName.textContent = categories[i];
    label.append(categoryName, document.createElement("br"), document.createTextNode(pct + "%"));
    announcement += categories[i] + ": " + pct + "%. ";
  });
  announcer.textContent = announcement.trim();
};
rg.querySelectorAll('input[type="range"]').forEach((input) => {
  input.addEventListener("input", update);
});
update();
`}
        />
    </ExampleCodeBlock>
    <script is:inline slot="runtime">
        (() => {
            const init = () => {
                const rg = document.querySelector("#budget-segment-range");
                const announcer = document.querySelector("#budget-segment-announcer");
                const labels = document.querySelectorAll(".budget-segment-label");
                const categories = ["Groceries", "Rent", "Transport", "Internet"];
                if (!rg) return;

                const update = () => {
                    const stops = [0, ...rg.values, 100];
                    let announcement = "Budget updated. ";
                    labels.forEach((label, i) => {
                        const pct = Math.round(stops[i + 1] - stops[i]);
                        label.style.setProperty("--budget-segment-label-center", `${(stops[i] + stops[i + 1]) / 2}%`);
                        label.replaceChildren();
                        const categoryName = document.createElement("strong");
                        categoryName.textContent = categories[i];
                        label.append(categoryName, document.createElement("br"), document.createTextNode(`${pct}%`));
                        announcement += categories[i] + ": " + pct + "%. ";
                    });
                    announcer.textContent = announcement.trim();
                };

                rg.querySelectorAll('input[type="range"]').forEach((input) => {
                    input.addEventListener("input", update);
                });
                update();
            };

            if (document.readyState === "loading") {
                document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", init, { once: true });
            } else {
                init();
            }
        })();
    </script>
</ExampleSection>
